 ProjectAchilles installer                                       Welcome  1 / 4
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 This wizard sets up ProjectAchilles on this server for your LAN.
 
   1. Check that this server is ready (read-only)
   2. Pick the network interface and the server's DNS name
   3. Choose how HTTPS certificates are issued
   4. Login (Clerk), analytics and organisation settings
   5. Review everything, then install
 
 Nothing on this server changes until you confirm on the Review step. Press esc
 to go back at any time.
 
 Press enter to start.








